          "id": 441697567,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hi,\nIt must be checked if this has been changed between the versions, as this code has been in Wireshark a long time\nchanging it may break dissection of other protocol versions. The file claims\n```\n-- Updated to version 3GPP TS 29.002 V7.5.0 (2006-09) Release 7\n-- Partially from ETS 300 599: December 2000 (GSM 09.02 version 4.19.1)\n```\nI'd be a bit reluctant to accept this change...",
